== References

This course was developed with reference to [https://inst.eecs.berkeley.edu/~cs70/su15/ CS70: Discrete Mathematics and Probability Theory] at UC Berkeley, [http://ocw.mit.edu/courses/electrical-engineering-and-computer-science/6-042j-mathematics-for-computer-science-fall-2010/ Mathematics for Computer Science] at MIT OpenCourseWare, and Kenneth H. Rosen, *Discrete Mathematics and Its Applications*, McGraw-Hill.

